  "create_new_age.ponder.energiser.header": "充能器",
  "create_new_age.ponder.energiser.text_1": "当提供电力与旋转时，充能器会为其下方的托盘与传送带上的物品充能。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.header": "发电",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.text_1": "当被旋转时，发电机线圈在周围有磁体时会产生电力。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.text_2": "线圈产生的电力可用碳刷方块收集。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.text_3": "随着环绕线圈的磁体磁力提高，SU 转换为电力的比例会上升。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.text_4": "效率：33.3%%",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.text_5": "效率：50.0%%",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.text_6": "不过效率越高，线圈消耗的 SU 也越多。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.generation.text_7": "注意：线圈不产生旋转，仅产生电力。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heater.header": "锅炉加热器",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heater.text_1": "锅炉加热器与烈焰人燃烧器类似，但使用热量而非可燃燃料。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heater.text_2": "提供的热量越多，释放的热量也越多。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.header": "加热系统",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_1": "白天可使用加热板产生热量。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_10": "80 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_11": "80 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_12": "斯特林发动机在下方获得热量时会缓慢开始旋转。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_13": "若提供更多热量，旋转会稍微加快。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_14": "可使用热泵向前输送热量！",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_15": "注意，方块过热会变成岩浆。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_2": "热管可用于分配热量。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_3": "240 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_4": "0 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_5": "0 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_6": "120 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_7": "120 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_8": "0 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.heating.text_9": "80 ˚T",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor.header": "电动机！",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor.text_1": "电动机允许你使用电力来产生旋转。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor.text_2": "可用扳手配置其速度，但其输出的 SU 保持不变。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor.text_3": "给红石信号可关闭它。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor.text_4": "也可右键将此机制反转。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor_extension.header": "电机扩展",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor_extension.text_1": "电机经常超载？试试电机扩展！",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor_extension.text_2": "扩展允许配置电机的应力容量倍数。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.motor_extension.text_3": "注意能耗与应力容量成正比。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.header": "使用核能",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.text_1": "核反应堆是产生大量热量的好方法。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.text_2": "反应堆的第一部分是反应堆棒，用于核反应发生。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.text_3": "第二部分是燃料插入器，用于向反应堆插入燃料。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.text_4": "最后是反应堆散热口，用于从反应堆收集热量并分配到连接的管道。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.text_5": "使用反应堆时需注意其会释放致命辐射。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.text_6": "可穿皮甲或用反应堆外壳/玻璃完全包覆来避免辐射。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.reactor.text_7": "此外必须有设备消耗反应堆热量，否则会出现小型熔毁。",
  "create_new_age.ponder.tag.electrical": "电气组件",
  "create_new_age.ponder.tag.electrical.description": "用于发电、输电与用电的方块。",
